  "title": "Specimen #001: The Doorway Forgetter",
  "tone": "documentary",
  "sources": [
    "Radvansky, Krawietz & Tamplin (2011). Walking through doorways causes forgetting. Quarterly Journal of Experimental Psychology, 64(8)",
    "Radvansky & Copeland (2006). Walking through doorways causes forgetting: situation models and experienced space. Memory & Cognition, 34(5)"
